        "Compare the four criteria of automatic processing - unintentionality, efficiency, uncontrollability, and unconsciousness - and design an experimental manipulation that tests each one. Then apply the pragmatic rules for studying automaticity: test each feature independently, distinguish operating conditions from operating principles, guard against null-effect inferences, and separate the formation from the expression of mental representations.",
